{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GENERATE-UUID function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":939,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309554","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GENERATE-UUID-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GENERATE-UUID-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GENERATE-UUID function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Generates a universally unique identifier (UUID),\nas a 16-byte RAW value. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function__syntax_GC18MA2693345\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d110599e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function__idGDL2HE2671012\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GENERATE-UUID</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function__example_GC18MB2693349\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d110599e122\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing code fragment illustrates how to use the GENERATE-UUID function:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function__idGDL2HF2671016\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE MyUUID     AS RAW       NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE Base64UUID AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.\n\nASSIGN \n  MyUUID     = GENERATE-UUID\n  Base64UUID = BASE64-ENCODE(MyUUID).</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can use the GENERATE-UUID function with\nthe BASE64-ENCODE function to generate a UUID and convert it to\nuse in a Base64 character index. You can also remove the two trailing\nBase64 pad characters to reduce the size of the UUID. For example:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function__idGDL2HG2671020\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>SUBSTRING(BASE64-ENCODE(GENERATE-UUID), 1, 22)</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GENERATE-UUID-function__see-also_GC18MC2693353\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d110599e174\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-ENCODE-function.html#BASE64-ENCODE-function\">BASE64-ENCODE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GUID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GUID-function.html#GUID-function\">GUID function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function.html\">GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-statement.html\">GET statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309554","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":939,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GENERATE-UUID function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-UUID-function.html","type":"Manual"}